{"model": "Chatterbox Turbo (MLX 8-bit)", "segments": [{"text": "Please Vote for us!!", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/406d64aa26c4bc1d473d941b6b4d1e0cef9695bc3952cf5801887339b5ec005f.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.54], [2, 0.54, 0.74], [3, 0.74, 1.02]]}, {"text": "Happiness Apps Challenge", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/9b8e000033ae5d43ac843300519ad995734166890e606b173242cccc9b46d0ce.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.42, 0.82], [2, 0.82, 1.24]]}, {"text": "Side projects are some of the best way for developers to learn new skills and maybe a little cash :-).", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/18308c2aaa6f2dca39c17790c3e475c7563359036b74cd7a52ef057a7af61282.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.66], [2, 0.66, 0.92], [3, 0.92, 1.08], [4, 1.08, 1.18], [5, 1.18, 1.28], [6, 1.28, 1.52], [7, 1.52, 1.68], [8, 1.68, 1.82], [9, 1.82, 2.26], [10, 2.26, 2.54], [11, 2.54, 2.68], [12, 2.68, 2.86], [13, 2.86, 3.16], [14, 3.16, 3.52], [15, 3.52, 3.74], [16, 3.74, 3.9], [17, 3.9, 4.06]]}, {"text": "I really enjoy attending Hackathon’s, because they really push my skillset as a developer.", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/423de7c37c7af9dbf4ab3c34e5e9bf1bd0c3e7f44d00c1f98b1a1ed312dc729a.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.48], [2, 0.48, 0.76], [3, 0.76, 1.14], [4, 1.14, 1.9], [5, 1.9, 2.34], [6, 2.34, 2.54], [7, 2.54, 2.76], [8, 2.76, 2.98], [9, 2.98, 3.18], [11, 3.66, 3.84], [12, 3.84, 3.92], [13, 3.92, 4.32]]}, {"text": "Most of my recently hackathons have required I learned android development, so I decided for my next project to buckle down and make a nicely designed, complicated android app.", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/6346cfbe99815731a8381bc6c36febaf60fcb3a9abee97a26731f8e83f95e897.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.42], [2, 0.42, 0.56], [3, 0.56, 0.94], [4, 0.94, 1.56], [5, 1.56, 1.72], [6, 1.72, 2.08], [7, 2.08, 2.3], [8, 2.3, 2.54], [9, 2.54, 2.88], [10, 2.88, 3.4], [11, 3.76, 4.04], [12, 4.04, 4.12], [13, 4.12, 4.42], [14, 4.42, 4.7], [15, 4.7, 4.82], [16, 4.82, 5.0], [17, 5.0, 5.4], [18, 5.4, 5.6], [19, 5.6, 5.8], [20, 5.8, 6.12], [21, 6.12, 6.32], [22, 6.32, 6.46], [23, 6.46, 6.6], [24, 6.6, 6.82], [25, 6.82, 7.44], [27, 7.94, 8.52], [28, 8.52, 8.9]]}, {"text": "The HappinessApps challenge was the perfect excuse for me to build an app worthy of my portfolio.", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/6f5ecdd581285d5b0325e431ac2a6c39747acaf9673de311f67667c78643e172.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [2, 0.84, 1.3], [3, 1.3, 1.62], [4, 1.62, 1.8], [5, 1.8, 2.14], [6, 2.14, 2.6], [7, 2.6, 2.9], [8, 2.9, 3.02], [9, 3.02, 3.12], [10, 3.12, 3.32], [11, 3.32, 3.56], [12, 3.56, 3.76], [13, 3.76, 4.1], [14, 4.1, 4.28], [15, 4.28, 4.42], [16, 4.42, 4.92]]}, {"text": "For the HappinessApps hackathon, Kevin Coleman and Haider Khan interviewed 57 unhappy people via Mechanical Turk that used to meditate.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/52ff9394120baf941f75b7760e1feaf2e346702d19b13d8d564a57f7f0e4af7e.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.34], [3, 0.98, 1.44], [4, 1.86, 2.0], [5, 2.0, 2.28], [6, 2.28, 2.54], [9, 2.96, 3.42], [10, 3.42, 4.04], [11, 4.04, 4.42], [12, 4.42, 4.88], [13, 4.88, 5.14], [14, 5.14, 5.46], [15, 5.46, 5.88], [16, 5.88, 6.26], [17, 6.26, 6.48], [18, 6.48, 6.6], [19, 6.6, 6.9]]}, {"text": "We wanted to know why they stopped meditating.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/02449d84f7ae4e1bc79f5d144a6f1adb77e55c43c20a22fe21f1647312ac6c48.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 0.64], [3, 0.64, 0.82], [4, 0.82, 1.1], [5, 1.1, 1.3], [6, 1.3, 1.64], [7, 1.64, 2.22]]}, {"text": "32 users felt frustrated with meditation, because they never felt like they were getting any better and weren’t confident that meditation was improving their happiness.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/bc07808e75b39d3dafe2b04dfc1a0951674ca5864817244ee966334a5abed449.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.36], [1, 0.36, 0.96], [2, 0.96, 1.2], [3, 1.2, 1.66], [4, 1.66, 1.94], [5, 1.94, 2.38], [6, 2.38, 2.92], [7, 2.92, 3.14], [8, 3.14, 3.36], [9, 3.36, 3.58], [10, 3.58, 3.82], [11, 3.82, 4.0], [12, 4.0, 4.12], [13, 4.12, 4.32], [14, 4.32, 4.64], [15, 4.64, 4.98], [16, 4.98, 5.54], [18, 5.66, 6.08], [19, 6.08, 6.38], [20, 6.38, 6.78], [21, 6.78, 7.12], [22, 7.12, 7.52], [23, 7.52, 7.72], [24, 7.72, 8.1]]}, {"text": "Enter HappyBeam", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/b62031d5f3535e7b9132d4af0b0edab41ba9458f1967a2e6c3e0a6e8f7be8f4b.mp3"}, {"text": "“If you can’t measure it, you can’t improve it.”", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/4d29d31df0a93fb10a3c9bd7034fa0ef08e8c071b1459a7a713e4031465adaaf.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.38], [2, 0.38, 0.7], [3, 0.7, 0.96], [4, 0.96, 1.22], [5, 1.38, 1.48], [6, 1.48, 1.76], [7, 1.76, 2.1], [8, 2.1, 2.42]]}, {"text": "-Peter Drucker", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/76c1cfe8631f10c17e6294d0aa4f0ae4f767680dfca381ae0cc2cf377b697b28.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.84]]}, {"text": "HappyBeam is the first app that is specifically designed to measure your inner peace by building up the bridge between physical movements and mental fluctuations.", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/de3f88f32fa84118e3320e41397bd82c79a68a3f1587b6950b8ab440ae6940ad.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.52, 0.74], [2, 0.74, 0.84], [3, 0.84, 1.16], [4, 1.16, 1.36], [5, 1.36, 1.58], [6, 1.58, 1.68], [7, 1.68, 2.22], [8, 2.22, 2.68], [9, 2.68, 2.96], [10, 2.96, 3.22], [11, 3.22, 3.44], [12, 3.44, 3.68], [14, 3.98, 4.3], [15, 4.3, 4.56], [16, 4.56, 4.78], [17, 4.78, 4.94], [18, 4.94, 5.18], [19, 5.18, 5.56], [20, 5.56, 5.94], [21, 5.94, 6.38], [22, 6.38, 6.72], [23, 6.72, 7.0], [24, 7.0, 7.44]]}, {"text": "It helps you have a peaceful mind, reduce stress and depression, and improves your meditations.", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/193ee49c19ab2955522cb9f60abf5248d297430de67aac7899efab12343b00dc.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.36], [2, 0.36, 0.52], [3, 0.52, 0.66], [4, 0.66, 0.76], [5, 0.76, 1.06], [6, 1.06, 1.54], [7, 1.86, 2.04], [8, 2.04, 2.38], [9, 2.38, 2.58], [10, 2.58, 2.94], [12, 3.32, 3.74], [13, 3.74, 3.94], [14, 3.94, 4.5]]}, {"text": "The less movement and lower the score that HappyBeam detects, the more you improve.", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/d98cf951b28561a2c4376ca79aec367e4a105d70eab742842853418e47998587.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.12], [1, 0.12, 0.26], [2, 0.26, 0.7], [3, 0.7, 0.98], [4, 0.98, 1.22], [5, 1.22, 1.44], [6, 1.44, 1.72], [7, 1.72, 1.94], [9, 2.48, 3.06], [10, 3.26, 3.32], [11, 3.32, 3.52], [12, 3.52, 3.7], [13, 3.7, 4.02]]}, {"text": "HappyBeam runs alongside meditation apps to measure how a user moves during a meditation.", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/6e4e543543178a5059866a090855883ae3068806744619a639fc57efaeb76426.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.5, 0.72], [2, 0.72, 1.3], [3, 1.3, 1.72], [4, 1.72, 2.22], [5, 2.22, 2.44], [6, 2.44, 2.68], [7, 2.68, 2.9], [8, 2.9, 3.02], [9, 3.02, 3.24], [10, 3.24, 3.58], [11, 3.58, 3.98], [12, 3.98, 4.08], [13, 4.08, 4.5]]}, {"text": "The app calculates a movement score using a cutting-edge algorithm.", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/170c8ab4d69114b9fd17815fe02713fc132f1de97289c3315e6765968aad8da2.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.36], [2, 0.36, 0.96], [3, 0.96, 1.04], [4, 1.04, 1.28], [5, 1.28, 1.6], [6, 1.6, 1.9], [7, 1.9, 2.06], [9, 2.5, 2.94]]}, {"text": "Happy-peaceful scores are marked green, not-so-good scores are yellow, high-anxiety scores are red.", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/a7c8a6a3aba51c31b48cbd5d73ff9e432e6b98c14e1fab26641c570df964f6c6.mp3"}, {"text": "In the “Your Meditations Chart”, users see their improving meditation scores across all their meditations.", "block": 9, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/ac6a64d5956da52699405dede6a8890ad506eb1c6edf6b350c53a1ced5c150a6.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.34], [3, 0.5, 1.14], [4, 1.14, 1.58], [5, 2.18, 2.36], [6, 2.36, 2.66], [7, 2.66, 2.84], [8, 2.84, 3.18], [9, 3.18, 3.62], [10, 3.62, 4.12], [11, 4.12, 4.46], [12, 4.46, 4.76], [13, 4.76, 4.88], [14, 4.88, 5.46]]}, {"text": "The history list shows a list of each session with a chart displaying when and how long they moved.", "block": 9, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/4a9d445bfa7efdbea2682de2f82ae405209e9e9249f6caa1dbf1f20ff0efa25e.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.14], [2, 0.42, 0.68], [3, 0.68, 1.02], [4, 1.02, 1.28], [5, 1.28, 1.44], [6, 1.44, 1.64], [7, 1.64, 1.8], [8, 1.8, 2.22], [9, 2.22, 2.46], [10, 2.46, 2.6], [11, 2.6, 2.84], [12, 2.84, 3.34], [13, 3.34, 3.68], [14, 3.68, 3.92], [15, 3.92, 4.1], [16, 4.1, 4.34], [17, 4.34, 4.52], [18, 4.52, 4.88]]}, {"text": "Currently, there is no other meditation apps that shows how a user is improving.", "block": 10, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/2744540b51e53afa83361b6e40407d7a9789fee1edf9e63c8e228a51574880c4.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.4], [3, 0.9, 1.04], [4, 1.04, 1.24], [5, 1.24, 1.64], [6, 1.64, 2.04], [7, 2.04, 2.22], [8, 2.22, 2.48], [9, 2.48, 2.7], [10, 2.7, 2.82], [11, 2.82, 3.02], [12, 3.02, 3.2], [13, 3.2, 3.58]]}, {"text": "HappyBeam leverages the latest Android Wear technology so that users can measure motion with their smartwatch.", "block": 11, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/622be59d0d09fac039398f67fca9666d063a824e592751fb8d519204ef191c00.mp3"}, {"text": "This delivers a better reading of their meditation.", "block": 11, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/437f7875701fc4d8940a263d0e3c573aba95b57991e375d7c24014931542745a.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.62], [2, 0.62, 0.8], [3, 0.8, 0.96], [4, 0.96, 1.22], [5, 1.22, 1.38], [6, 1.38, 1.52], [7, 1.52, 2.0]]}, {"text": "HappyBeam was built in 3 weeks for the Happiness Apps challenge.", "block": 12, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/898de5c8be7cafea97e9daba8a09de380d9802a184900cc142830e80b01e121a.mp3"}, {"text": "Website", "block": 13, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/4e09c6dfccf96d26b96a31de9255db8d3758391756baca6cb02f8bc1b41adfb9.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.46]]}, {"text": "Android Play Store​", "block": 14, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/ae86d42fb0d80184c95b752d209c859087b9849db753e29d3077be687bc475d2.mp3"}]}